{
  "note": "Golden vectors for the push vocabulary of envelope v2: watch and unwatch, every event topic, a stream-ending err, and the attachment commands. Same schema and rules as frames.json; written by the Go FrameWriter (LOLA_WRITE_VECTORS=1 rewrites only the hex). Key order inside each payload is the Go struct's declaration order and is significant.",
